        "to": 0.9
      },
      "intent": "The caster drinks in sunlight. Golden motes and green glints drift in from all around and spiral into the hand, a sun glyph opens under their feet, the light in the hand swells from gold to white and the whole scene brightens. Long and readable: this is the dodge window."
    },
