    "notes": "Mote paths and swirl, the glint twinkle, the lance's slight drift, the bloom spray and the sun-mark's texture vary per cast. The 1.15 s gather, the release time and the 0.15 s reach stay fixed: the long wind-up is the point of the spell and the dodge window has to be the same every time."
